    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 475540,
      "end_ms": 479560,
      "text": "意图为这个组织去设想准备共同的权利意图"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 479560,
      "end_ms": 484820,
      "text": "这个权利意图是一个省份某种学派的地位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 484820,
      "end_ms": 487160,
      "text": "还是更狂野的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 487160,
      "end_ms": 488080,
      "text": "百会穴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 488080,
      "end_ms": 489780,
      "text": "那么到了上滩田的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 489780,
      "end_ms": 491820,
      "text": "这边就是大家分享一个组织"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 491820,
      "end_ms": 495290,
      "text": "大家分享共同的主E啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 495290,
      "end_ms": 497840,
      "text": "上当前这里嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 501960,
      "end_ms": 503080,
      "text": "泥丸宫啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 503080,
      "end_ms": 505880,
      "text": "这个时候大家分享共同的主意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 507320,
      "end_ms": 510830,
      "text": "那么但是这个时候的这个主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 510830,
      "end_ms": 513720,
      "text": "他并不是特别凝练的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 513720,
      "end_ms": 515340,
      "text": "他不是那种非常好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 515340,
      "end_ms": 518940,
      "text": "就是因为这里还是集中在中丹田的修行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 518940,
      "end_ms": 520490,
      "text": "所以它降下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 520490,
      "end_ms": 524339,
      "text": "然后是在这个是什啊银交穴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 524339,
      "end_ms": 526859,
      "text": "然后再到里面上去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 526859,
      "end_ms": 531470,
      "text": "这个时候就是看你的表达啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 531470,
      "end_ms": 535890,
      "text": "向他进行了一个表达仪式性的表达"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 535890,
      "end_ms": 538670,
      "text": "或者说我们说这是个效忠过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 538670,
      "end_ms": 541110,
      "text": "效忠表达的过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 542170,
      "end_ms": 543610,
      "text": "然后婚姻会有仪式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 543610,
      "end_ms": 546430,
      "text": "这个过程也会有仪式啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 546430,
      "end_ms": 549630,
      "text": "这个过程也是我是通过啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 549630,
      "end_ms": 552630,
      "text": "这个先大家分有个共同主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 552630,
      "end_ms": 555030,
      "text": "然后这些东西往往是通过什么读书班"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 555030,
      "end_ms": 557740,
      "text": "地下读书班啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 557740,
      "end_ms": 561260,
      "text": "或者说是这个什么什么学习会啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 561260,
      "end_ms": 565560,
      "text": "这种玩意其实就是预备性的组织"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 565560,
      "end_ms": 568240,
      "text": "然后再发展到中丹田这里啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 568240,
      "end_ms": 569260,
      "text": "檀中穴什么下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 569260,
      "end_ms": 571920,
      "text": "那就是实现这个组织啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 571920,
      "end_ms": 574520,
      "text": "这就组织起来了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 574520,
      "end_ms": 575480,
      "text": "这组织起来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 575480,
      "end_ms": 577060,
      "text": "然后再降到下丹田"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 577060,
      "end_ms": 579330,
      "text": "他就是在右个人的欲望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 579330,
      "end_ms": 580650,
      "text": "这个时候所有的个人欲望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 580650,
      "end_ms": 585110,
      "text": "都变成是推动组织进步发展的那种欲望了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 585110,
      "end_ms": 586250,
      "text": "这是还有渡线眼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 586250,
      "end_ms": 586910,
      "text": "杜线的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 586910,
      "end_ms": 591610,
      "text": "那就是这个欲望还要孕育新的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 591610,
      "end_ms": 593925,
      "text": "他要孕育新的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 597280,
      "end_ms": 599740,
      "text": "他就是组织的发展性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 599740,
      "end_ms": 604040,
      "text": "使发展的那种就拉摇更多人进去的那个目的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 604040,
      "end_ms": 606410,
      "text": "就是人员单法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 607410,
      "end_ms": 610640,
      "text": "这个一开始是这个周天循环"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 610640,
      "end_ms": 614440,
      "text": "小周天把这这个通路上的穴道都打通"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 614440,
      "end_ms": 618300,
      "text": "那么这个个体本来有的情欲生殖欲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 618300,
      "end_ms": 621640,
      "text": "本来有的摆脱他的孤独或创"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 621640,
      "end_ms": 623360,
      "text": "拥抱爱情和婚姻的欲望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 623360,
      "end_ms": 625899,
      "text": "就变成了现身于一个组织"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 625899,
      "end_ms": 627459,
      "text": "变成一个组织啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 627459,
      "end_ms": 630939,
      "text": "组织内在的一个生命力扩张欲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 633960,
      "end_ms": 635520,
      "text": "所以在这种意义上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 635520,
      "end_ms": 641460,
      "text": "我们说这个他的过程会使得"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 641460,
      "end_ms": 644700,
      "text": "就这个进到这个阶段"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 644700,
      "end_ms": 650040,
      "text": "成员就是休息到这阶段就已经有组织了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 650040,
      "end_ms": 652360,
      "text": "弹就是已经有中丹田了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 652360,
      "end_ms": 654240,
      "text": "中丹田以及有中丹田"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 654240,
      "end_ms": 656600,
      "text": "这个中丹田就是固定的一个组织"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 656600,
      "end_ms": 657520,
      "text": "一个场所"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 657520,
      "end_ms": 660490,
      "text": "然后所有的激情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 660490,
      "end_ms": 664050,
      "text": "所有成员的激情都能够炼精化气啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 664050,
      "end_ms": 666280,
      "text": "已经炼精化气成功了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 666280,
      "end_ms": 669910,
      "text": "炼精化气化气就就成功了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 670110,
      "end_ms": 672390,
      "text": "这些气积攒在中丹田当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 672390,
      "end_ms": 676940,
      "text": "中丹田这个就有点像穴道被打通了一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 680980,
      "end_ms": 681820,
      "text": "谭中旭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 690000,
      "end_ms": 694550,
      "text": "然后这个小周天是会自动运行的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 694550,
      "end_ms": 697750,
      "text": "它会它能自动运行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 700339,
      "end_ms": 703499,
      "text": "啊就它能够自如地自动运行的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 703499,
      "end_ms": 708140,
      "text": "就从地缘单发发发展到了这个人元旦法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 708140,
      "end_ms": 710180,
      "text": "发展到了围绕中丹田的修行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 710180,
      "end_ms": 711840,
      "text": "那么围绕中丹田的修行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 711840,
      "end_ms": 714180,
      "text": "他其实是怎样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 714590,
      "end_ms": 718230,
      "text": "是要炼气化神啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 718230,
      "end_ms": 719710,
      "text": "变成神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 721300,
      "end_ms": 726170,
      "text": "那么首先他结成的其实是阴神啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 726170,
      "end_ms": 727790,
      "text": "首先节省的是鹰神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 727790,
      "end_ms": 729410,
      "text": "这个鹰神的是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 729410,
      "end_ms": 732170,
      "text": "是一个计划"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 732480,
      "end_ms": 735560,
      "text": "再明确点纲领啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 735560,
      "end_ms": 739360,
      "text": "就是一种就是替代性计划"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 740470,
      "end_ms": 742410,
      "text": "他所以除了他是鹰神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 742410,
      "end_ms": 743230,
      "text": "他是替代性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 743230,
      "end_ms": 745350,
      "text": "而且是个预预备计划"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 745350,
      "end_ms": 746870,
      "text": "预谋的计划"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 746870,
      "end_ms": 753980,
      "text": "替代性的一个预谋的一个计划替代性的好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 753980,
      "end_ms": 758200,
      "text": "这个过程就是说在这个组织的循环当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 758200,
      "end_ms": 762260,
      "text": "就这个这个组织的自我循环当中啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 762260,
      "end_ms": 763960,
      "text": "组织组织怎么说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 763960,
      "end_ms": 764780,
      "text": "组织怎么想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 764780,
      "end_ms": 767380,
      "text": "在他的自动循环自我循环当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 767380,
      "end_ms": 769900,
      "text": "他开始称成社会图景"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 769900,
      "end_ms": 775200,
      "text": "生成他的预谋性的替代性的计划性的社会图景"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 776730,
      "end_ms": 780170,
      "text": "这个社会图景就是练出来的鹰神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 780800,
      "end_ms": 781820,
      "text": "念出来的阴沉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 781820,
      "end_ms": 787600,
      "text": "或者这个主义所允诺的未来的乌托邦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 789190,
      "end_ms": 790230,
      "text": "未来乌托邦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 790230,
      "end_ms": 791250,
      "text": "他不是阳神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 791250,
      "end_ms": 793110,
      "text": "他不是他没有解放区的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 793110,
      "end_ms": 794150,
      "text": "没那地盘哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 794150,
      "end_ms": 795710,
      "text": "这样的组织他是地下组织啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 795710,
      "end_ms": 797250,
      "text": "他处处地下行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 797250,
      "end_ms": 798619,
      "text": "他是个地下组织"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 798619,
      "end_ms": 801510,
      "text": "地下组织只有那种预谋性的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 801510,
      "end_ms": 802630,
      "text": "密谋性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 802630,
      "end_ms": 803990,
      "text": "甚至说密谋性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 803990,
      "end_ms": 806790,
      "text": "然后计划性的替代性的一个社会图景"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 806790,
      "end_ms": 812710,
      "text": "用这个社会图景来征召来带动带动这些气啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 812710,
      "end_ms": 814310,
      "text": "这些气就是他的否定性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 814310,
      "end_ms": 815190,
      "text": "无产阶的否定性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 815190,
      "end_ms": 816310,
      "text": "无产阶之治啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 816310,
      "end_ms": 817700,
      "text": "推翻什么什么的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 817700,
      "end_ms": 822360,
      "text": "创造一个新世界的那种志志气志气啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 822360,
      "end_ms": 826450,
      "text": "啊那么这个由鹰神牵引着"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 826450,
      "end_ms": 829870,
      "text": "牵引这个组织内的每个个体的生命力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 829870,
      "end_ms": 833720,
      "text": "产生出来的那些力量转化成心理图景啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 833720,
      "end_ms": 835260,
      "text": "转化成社会图景"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 835260,
      "end_ms": 836520,
      "text": "这就是阴神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 836520,
      "end_ms": 839240,
      "text": "这个阴神也会出阴神的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 839240,
      "end_ms": 840220,
      "text": "什么初音神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 840220,
      "end_ms": 842980,
      "text": "相当于这个这么一个允诺的主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 842980,
      "end_ms": 846010,
      "text": "所允诺的乌托邦这个社会图景啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 846010,
      "end_ms": 848810,
      "text": "在历史当中开始做竞争啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 848910,
      "end_ms": 850770,
      "text": "与其他的理论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 850770,
      "end_ms": 851890,
      "text": "其他的学派啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 851890,
      "end_ms": 855170,
      "text": "或者其他的思想流派啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 855170,
      "end_ms": 856850,
      "text": "思潮进行一个竞争"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 856850,
      "end_ms": 858275,
      "text": "一个斗争"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 858630,
      "end_ms": 860089,
      "text": "但无论如何"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 860089,
      "end_ms": 863489,
      "text": "到了这个人元丹法这里啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 863489,
      "end_ms": 867169,
      "text": "到了这个围绕着这个中丹田的一个练习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 867169,
      "end_ms": 868289,
      "text": "这里啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 868289,
      "end_ms": 872130,
      "text": "他是一个练气存神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 872130,
      "end_ms": 874350,
      "text": "炼气成神的一种状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 874350,
      "end_ms": 877010,
      "text": "它是由心来牵引着的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 877010,
      "end_ms": 879525,
      "text": "由心来牵引这个肾的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 880140,
      "end_ms": 886040,
      "text": "然后他会从小周天逐步过渡到这个大周天啊"
