    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 897730,
      "end_ms": 900270,
      "text": "然后这下面肚子这一块也会有一圈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 900270,
      "end_ms": 902910,
      "text": "然后下面腿也会有一圈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 904580,
      "end_ms": 908340,
      "text": "啊那么这些循环呢就是这个组织的发展"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 908340,
      "end_ms": 909460,
      "text": "大周天打通"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 909460,
      "end_ms": 911300,
      "text": "打通大周天的过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 911300,
      "end_ms": 913050,
      "text": "就是这个组织发展的过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 913050,
      "end_ms": 917630,
      "text": "这个组织会产生出它的有机构成部分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 917630,
      "end_ms": 920610,
      "text": "武力的思想的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 920610,
      "end_ms": 921550,
      "text": "经济的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 921550,
      "end_ms": 922470,
      "text": "政治的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 922470,
      "end_ms": 924890,
      "text": "意识形态的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 924890,
      "end_ms": 926810,
      "text": "教育的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 926810,
      "end_ms": 927910,
      "text": "还有就是对外的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 927910,
      "end_ms": 930190,
      "text": "对内的等等等等这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 930190,
      "end_ms": 933930,
      "text": "这个组织能够然后打通大周天"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 933930,
      "end_ms": 935270,
      "text": "打通大周天的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 935270,
      "end_ms": 938550,
      "text": "他就能够把他的阴神练成阳神"
